msgstr "因 20/40 MHz 共存调整信道或频宽"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:594
msgid ""
"Allows a narrower bandwidth during DFS with automatic 5 GHz channel "
"selection and no ACS channel list. Clients joining during a foreground DFS "
"check must wait."
msgstr ""
"5 GHz 自动选频且信道列表留空时，允许因 DFS 临时降宽。前台 DFS 检测期间，新接"
"入终端需要等待。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/root/usr/share/ucode/luci/controller/admin/router_tool.uc:250
msgid ""
"Another configuration change is waiting for confirmation. Confirm it or wait "
"for it to roll back."
msgstr "另一批配置变更正在等待确认。请确认该变更，或等待其自动回滚。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:466
msgid "Applied a channel switch request"
msgstr "已执行信道切换请求"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:299
msgid "Automatic AP conversion conflicts with network section:"
msgstr "自动转换为 AP 与以下网络配置节冲突："

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:305
msgid ""
"Automatic AP conversion requires plain Ethernet ports. Configure VLAN or "
"switch topologies manually."
msgstr "自动 AP 转换适用于普通以太网端口，VLAN 或传统交换机拓扑请手动配置。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:465
#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:484
msgid "Bandwidth selected from available channel blocks"
msgstr "按可用信道块选宽"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:287
msgid ""
"Cannot identify the Ethernet WAN device. Configure LAN/WAN devices first."
msgstr "无法确定有线 WAN 设备，请先配置 LAN/WAN 设备。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:285
msgid "Cannot read board port assignments. Configure AP ports manually."
msgstr "无法读取板级网口配置，请手动配置 AP 网口。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:457
