msgstr "关闭"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:589
msgid ""
"Enter channel numbers from 1 to 233 or ascending ranges, separated by spaces."
msgstr "请输入 1 到 233 的信道编号或升序范围，并用空格分隔。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:462
msgid "Following the station uplink channel"
msgstr "正在跟随 STA 上联信道"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:687
msgid ""
"Manual changes are preserved. Concurrent edits to the same settings or "
"incompatible device assignments stop the switch."
msgstr "保留手动修改；同时修改同一设置或设备分配冲突时会停止切换。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:686
msgid ""
"Manually enable to bridge all Ethernet ports and obtain IPv4/IPv6 from the "
"upstream router; disable to restore the previous settings. When disabled, "
"PPPoE automatically uses main-router mode and other WAN protocols use sub-"
"router mode."
msgstr ""
"手动启用后将全部网口桥接，从上级获取 IPv4/IPv6；取消后恢复之前的设置。未启用"
"时，PPPoE 自动采用主路由模式，其他 WAN 协议采用子路由模式。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:121
msgid "Mode switch refused: ambiguous matching configuration sections:"
msgstr "已停止模式切换：以下配置节存在多个匹配项："

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:179
msgid ""
"Mode switch refused: an AP snapshot exists while AP mode is disabled. "
"Restore AP mode and use LuCI to switch back."
msgstr ""
"已停止模式切换：AP 模式已关闭但仍有 AP 快照，请恢复 AP 模式后通过 LuCI 关闭。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:182
msgid ""
"Mode switch refused: configuration changed while this page was open. Reload "
"the page."
msgstr "已停止模式切换：打开页面后设备配置已发生变化，请刷新页面。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:126
msgid "Mode switch refused: reserved section already exists at"
msgstr "已停止模式切换：以下保留配置节已存在："

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:167
msgid ""
"Mode switch refused: saved configuration snapshot is missing or invalid."
msgstr "已停止模式切换：配置快照缺失或无效。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:111
#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:634
