msgstr "已停止模式切换：以下配置节的类型已改变："

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:405
msgid ""
"Mode switch refused: the active WAN device is still part of the LAN bridge. "
"Review device assignments."
msgstr "已停止模式切换：启用的 WAN 设备仍在 LAN 网桥中，请检查设备分配。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:173
#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:199
