msgstr "正在自动选信道"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:565
msgid ""
"Separate channels with spaces. Use a hyphen for a range. Leave empty to use "
"every channel compatible with the selected bandwidth."
msgstr "用空格分隔信道，范围用连字符表示。留空则使用所有与所选频宽匹配的信道。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:458
msgid "Skipped channel blocks in the DFS non-occupancy period"
msgstr "已跳过 DFS 禁用期内的信道块"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:438
