#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/root/usr/share/ucode/luci/controller/admin/router_tool.uc:244
msgid "The ACS list has no usable channel for the selected band and bandwidth."
msgstr "ACS 列表在所选频段和带宽下没有可用信道。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:688
msgid ""
"The upstream router may assign a new management address. With checked apply, "
"LuCI rolls back if it cannot confirm the change before the timer expires."
msgstr ""
"上级路由器可能分配新的管理地址。使用带回滚的应用时，如果 LuCI 无法在倒计时内"
"确认，系统会恢复之前的配置。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:72
